			<div class="c-content-right">
				<h2 class="u-a2 js-animated-stagger-element">How to get here</h2>

				<div class="c-content-right__description js-animated-stagger-element">
					<p>
						To get to Kalmia Woods, you can take a ferry from the mainland port of Prapratno, which
						is located on the Peljesac Peninsula. Ferries run regularly from Prapratno to Sobra, the
						main port on Kalmia Woods.
					</p>

					<p>
						Alternatively, you can take a catamaran from Dubrovnik to Sobra, which takes about 1.5
						hours. Once you arrive at Sobra, you can rent a car or take a bus to explore the island.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
